{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1336806-trinity-core-example-weapons-seem-uh-what","id":1336806,"title":"[Trinity Core] Example weapons seem...uh...what?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-19T02:39:21-07:00","id":1336806,"title":"[Trinity Core] Example weapons seem...uh...what?","content":"Okay, so, I'm looking at the example weapon table on page 125. Your maximum weapon tag value is Wealth + 1. So, if I'm not mistaken, here are the number of tags for each weapon you can acquire:<br /> <br /> Assault Rifle 7, Katana 4, Knife 3, Pistol 3, Stun Gun 3, Grenade 3<br /> <br /> This doesn't seem right, since it'd mean you can't actually get an assault rifle with any amount of Wealth and most weapons require multiple dots in Wealth, but it's not supposed to be a mandatory thing for basic character concepts. That doesn't sound intentional, especially having to be solidly middle-class to afford a knife.<br /> <br /> Also, why does the Assault Rifle only have Enhancement 2 but the Katana has Enhancement 3, even though they both have Quality 2 and Two-Handed?<br /> <br /> I'm guessing this was based on an old version of the rules and wasn't updated, or something?<br /> <br /> (Edited to make my point clearer.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1711,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","user":"Zeea","date":". 09-19-2019, 05:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T02:59:21-07:00","id":1336809,"title":"","content":"I have seen it too, the Armors have the same issue. I think they didn\u2019t think too much about it in core, as in Aeon it\u2019s better balanced.<br /> On the cost problem I would change to Wealth +3 for Weapons and Wealth +2 for Armors.<br /> <br /> On the enhancement, I think it missed a latter change because I think there was a Quality 3 somewhere, probably Katana. Any way, the enhancements with the tags as shown should be 3 for both.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T03:04:04-07:00","id":1336811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zeea</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1336806-trinity-core-example-weapons-seem-uh-what#post1336806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, so, I'm looking at the example weapon table on page 125. Your maximum weapon tag value is Wealth + 1. So, if I'm not mistaken, here are the number of tags for each weapon you can acquire:<br /> <br /> Assault Rifle 7, Katana 4, Knife 3, Pistol 3, Stun Gun 3, Grenade 3<br /> <br /> So, it's impossible for anyone in the entire world to afford an assault rifle because you'd need more money than Jeff Bezos before the divorce, you have to be upper class to have a katana, and only middle class people can carry knives. (Also, the Wealth rating explicitly says it represents extra spending money and no dots of Wealth doesn't mean poverty, so most characters couldn't even afford their own hands if they didn't get Unarmed for free.)<br /> <br /> That can't be right. What am I missing here? Is this an old version of the document, or am I misreading, or...what?<br /> <br /> Also, why does the Assault Rifle only have Enhancement 2 but the Katana has Enhancement 3, even though they both have Quality 2 and Two-Handed?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I agree with you that it's bit weird, but as a general rule I tell my players not to worry about wealth when it comes to things. The reason is because as far as I'm concerned the organizations are the ones responsible for providing the players with whathever resources (Equipment, weapons, vehicles, etc...) they may need, within reason of course. In our game we tend to use wealth more as a &quot;social&quot; asset (Bribes, donations, influence, etc...). That said I'm really curious to see what the others have to say since I can undertand how a player may want more independence and have ownership of their equipment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}